===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Napoleon}}

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|fr|Napoléon||given name, usually in reference to {{w|Napoleon Bonaparte}}}}. In reference to coins, via {{bor|en|fr|napoléon||(slang) a coin that originally had the appearance of Napoleon's face in the obverse|notext=1}}.<ref>"[http://www.oed.com/view/Entry/258537 Napoleon, ''n.¹'']" in the ''Oxford English Dictionary'' (2003), Oxford: Oxford University Press.</ref> In reference to guns and possibly cards, in reference to {{w|Napoleon III}}.

