# {{lb|en|card games|uncountable}} A 19th-[[century]] 5-[[card]] [[trick]]-[[taking]] [[card game|game]] [[simplified]] from [[euchre]].
# {{lb|en|card games|uncountable}} {{clipping of|double napoleon|lang=en|nodot=a}}: a [[form]] of [[patience]].
# {{lb|en|rare|_|UK|_|horse racing|_|slang|obsolete}} {{altform|nap|lang=en|nodot=a}}: a [[horse]] to [[go nap on]], a [[sure thing]], a [[certain]] [[winner]]; a [[prediction]] of [[such]] a [[horse]]; a [[bet]] on [[such]] a [[horse]].
